oining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.\",\"knowsAbout\":[\"Federal Income Tax\",\"State Income Tax\",\"FICA Tax\",\"Payroll Tax\",\"IRS Compliance\",\"Tax Planning\",\"Multi-State Taxation\",\"Tax-Advantaged Accounts\"],\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rachelmitchellcpa/\",\"https://www.aicpa-cima.com/\"],\"worksFor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},\"image\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/free-tax-calculator-no-signup-2026#article\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Free Tax Calculator 2026 — No Signup, No Email, Instant Results\",\"description\":\"Free 2026 tax calculator with no signup, no email, no paywall. Calculate take-home pay, tax refund, self-employment tax, and more. CPA-reviewed accuracy.\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630},\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-21T14:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-06-21T14:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/free-tax-calculator-no-signup-2026#author\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/free-tax-calculator-no-signup-2026\"},\"keywords\":[\"free\",\"tax\",\"calculator\",\"no\",\"signup\",\"2026\",\"free tax calculator\",\"no signup\",\"tax calculator 2026\",\"take home pay\",\"how much tax do i owe\"],\"wordCount\":969,\"articleSection\":\"Tax Guide\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/free-tax-calculator-no-signup-2026#breadcrumb\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog\"}